1. Establish facts and unanswered questions


| ID | Explicit facts - edvidace |
|---|---|
| F01 | The community makersoace currently advertise public workshop on noticeboard |
| F02 | Browse workshops by topic and date. |
| F03 | View each workshop's title, venue, date and remaining places. 
| F04 | A user can submit a requst for a place at one workshop |
| F05 | The request records by name and email. |
| F06 | Organiser reviews each request and approves or rejects it. |


