| Unknown | Question | Decision|
|---|---|---|
| Group Booking | Whether residents can reuest multiple places for other people in one request. | Manager |
| Cancellation | Whether residents can cancel a request or approved place abd rules to apply. | Manager 
| Reminders | Whether the system should send reminders | Manager |


1.3 Scope

The Community Makerspace service will not include online payment, payment processing or payment collection. 

2. Connect Process and RE Work

2.1 Four-step process


| Step | How | Features |
|---|---|---|
| Specification | Identify and documentt what users need. | Record the residents need to browse workshops by topic and date. |
| Development | Build the software feature based on specification | Developers create a workshop listing with topic and date filters. |
| Software Validation | Check whether the feature meets the requirements. | Test if residents can filter and see matching results. |
| Evolution | Maintain or improve the software after feedback | Improve the filters if residents report difficulty finding. 


